kémon Gym\\nLeader: Clair\\fThe Blessed User of Dragon Pokémon","msg_0629_T30_00012":"Move Deleter and Move Tutor House\\rA Mysterious House Where You Can Make\\nPokémon Forget and Remember Moves","msg_0629_T30_00013":"Dragon’s Den Ahead","msg_0629_T30_00014":"Trainer Tips\\rWild Pokémon will appear regularly\\nif you don’t run, but walk quietly in the\\ftall grass.\\rIf your party Pokémon are\\ntired, it is better to avoid running,\\fand go straight to a Pokémon Center."},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_407B","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_T30_007 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T30_005 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T30_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_013":13,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_014":14,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_015":15,"_EV_scr_seq_T30_016":16,"obj_T30_gsman1":0,"obj_T30_gsoldman1":1,"obj_T30_gsfighter":2,"obj_T30_gswoman3":3,"obj_T30_gsboy1":4,"obj_T30_gswoman3_2":5,"obj_T30_gsman1_2":6,"obj_T30_gsoldman1_2":7,"obj_T30_gsboy2":8,"obj_T30_gsmiddleman1":9}}
